  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">突變生物模組</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此展示影片已過時：</span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A58vyUDBEi8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;amp\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1405/298/310/172/9dd146729ba99fe2a4c8cfaec9fc3703cf54a397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"251\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;amp\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-size:24px\">此模組新增更多突變怪物</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">獵人槍是對抗突變怪物的有效武器</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;amp\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\">獵人槍的子彈是箭矢</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">突變殭屍化豬布林</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：200</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：10</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">護甲值：30</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若不攻擊突變殭屍化豬布林，牠也不會攻擊你</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">突變豬布林蠻兵</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：700</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：12</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：？</span></p><pre>&nbsp;</pre><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變流髑</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：200</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：15</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：20</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">突變沼骸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：500</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：10</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：10</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變殭屍村民</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">生命值：100</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">傷害：50</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變沉屍</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">生命值：300</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">傷害：15</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：10</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">突變豬屍獸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">生命值：400</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">傷害：15</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">護甲值：30</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變鐵巨人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">生命值：270</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">護甲值：100</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">傷害：30</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">突變獄髓巨人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：700</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：100</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">突變劫毀獸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">生命值：900</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">傷害：300</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變伏守者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：1024</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：55</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變凋零怪</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：800</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：錯誤</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此怪物擁有模擬指令方塊的力量，非常危險，但因其僅具備模擬指令方塊，處理指令行的能力極差，不如真正的指令方塊。因此此怪物無法成為凋零風暴。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">掉落物（V1.1.0）：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>「模擬指令方塊的一部分」。為神秘配方所需物品</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">突變熾足獸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">生命值：450</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">傷害：30</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">突變終界龍</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：400</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：50</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">掉落物（V1.1.0）：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>「M」。為神秘配方所需物品</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">突變嗅探獸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：350</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：15</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：5</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">阿爾法突變鐵巨人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：1000</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：60</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">突變地獄幽靈</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">生命值：600</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傷害：不明</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">護甲值：100</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">巨型掠奪者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">他是創造許多突變怪物的幕後主使，極難擊敗，擁有多種不同技能，請注意其主要活動區域在叢林</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">掉落物（V1.1.0）：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>「神秘藥水」。為神秘配方所需物品</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><pre><span>原始終界龍外觀由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252faspirin60%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aspirin60</a> 創作</span></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
